{"availability":"available","full":"timoncool/ACE-Step-Studio","name":"ACE-Step-Studio","description":"Portable AI music generator — full songs with vocals, covers, music videos. One-click install, 100% offline, NVIDIA GPU.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":387,"forks":56,"created":"2026-04-10T23:34:01Z","updated":"2026-10-10T05:30:19Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://timoncool.github.io/ACE-Step-Studio/","topics":["ace-step","ai-music","gradio","local-ai","lyrics","music-generation","music-video","offline","one-click-install","portable","pytorch","text-to-music","vocals","windows"],"demo":"https://timoncool.github.io/ACE-Step-Studio/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T09:07:52.316Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T09:07:52.316Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T09:07:52.316Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T17:13:26.123Z","stars":377,"forks":54},{"at":"2026-10-08T22:33:35.774Z","stars":383,"forks":54},{"at":"2026-10-10T09:07:52.316Z","stars":387,"forks":56}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Suno at home: full songs with vocals from ACE-Step 1.5 on your own GPU. One executable — no Python, no Node.js, no launcher.","ACE-Step Studio is a desktop studio for ACE-Step 1.5, the open music model that writes and sings full songs. Describe a sound and write lyrics — or give it a one-line idea — and it plans the song with its language model and renders it with vocals on your own graphics card. Covers, remixes, repaints, a LoRA catalogue, your own LoRA trained on your songs, stems, MIDI, karaoke and video clips, all in one window. Windows installer with auto-update or a portable folder, runs offline on NVIDIA cards from 4 GB of VRAM.","It is built on acestep.cpp, the native C++/GGML port of ACE-Step 1.5. The studio around it is Rust and React in a Tauri window — nothing in the runtime path is Python."],"features":["A player of its own — a ten-band equalizer on Winam